At runtime pixelforge links against libvips (LGPL-2.1-or-later, https://github.com/libvips/libvips).
The Docker images optionally ship the prebuilt libvips bundle from the sharp project
(@img/sharp-libvips, LGPL-3.0-or-later). The API is modelled on sharp
(https://sharp.pixelplumbing.com/, Apache License 2.0); no sharp source code is included.
